                            // <p>
                            Text {
                                text: "The first rewrite moved us from a set of hand-written scripts to a single orchestrator. It worked for a while. Then the scripts came back in the form of <small>pre-build.sh</small> hooks, one for each team, each with its own idea of what a clean checkout means."
                                textFormat: Text.StyledText
